&lt;p&gt;At PhonePe, we go the extra mile to make sure you can bring your best self to work, Everyday!. And that starts with creating the right environment for you. We empower people and trust them to do the right&amp;nbsp; thing. Here, you own your work from start to finish, right from day one. PhonePe-rs solve complex problems and execute quickly; often building frameworks from scratch. If you’re excited by the idea of building platforms that touch millions, ideating with some of&amp;nbsp; the best minds in the country and executing on your dreams with purpose and speed, join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;video controls=&quot;controls&quot; width=&quot;300&quot; height=&quot;150&quot;&gt;
&lt;source src=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1mkZstuTlMFTM8sDh1x4NYm7WSLueqklb/view?resourcekey&quot;&gt;&lt;/video&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Candidate will be responsible for ensuring adherence to IRDAI regulations, RBI’s Digital Lending guidelines, circulars, guidelines, and other applicable regulatory requirements. The role will involve advising business teams on compliance aspects, implementing regulatory updates, maintaining effective reporting mechanisms, assisting in internal audit&amp;nbsp; and ensuring robust compliance governance across the organization.This position also provides exposure to other regulatory frameworks beyond insurance, enabling a well-rounded compliance career path.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track, interpret, and disseminate IRDAI,RBI circulars, guidelines, and exposure drafts to stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure timely implementation of new regulations and monitor their impact on business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct compliance risk assessments, including analysis of regulatory penalty/warning orders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review products, advertisements, and business proposals from a regulatory compliance perspective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support preparation of compliance dashboards, regulatory updates, and committee presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide inputs on business projects and proposals to ensure compliance considerations are embedded before launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise stakeholders on compliance risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in conducting thematic compliance reviews and support management reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
