&lt;li&gt;Proven experience crafting and delivering successful ABM programs within Public Sector&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to partner with PubSec sales leaders and translate agency mission goals into targeted marketing strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident in driving multi-channel campaigns and executive-level engagement programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ABM platforms (e.g., Demandbase, 6sense, Userled), Salesforce, and marketing automation tools like Marketo&lt;/li&gt;
